{"generated": "2026-10-24 17:56", "brief": "<b>1. SK하이닉스의 솔리다임 미국 IPO 검토 중단</b>\nSK하이닉스가 자회사 솔리다임의 미국 상장 추진을 시장 변동성과 주주 반발 등을 고려해 전격 중단했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNVFZ2SWp1Y2YwZmFuZzdZd25EOE9NVXFiM19lV1czZXJHaDRBRGowOC1mTDJuNWEzb3czMVVoRjA4RDFZdEtPM3NVcWxZQjY4ak5MVk9IeDdLbXlTVnNVdHhleFUtTng1dC10SVZzMk1JTlVPRzZ1MWVENEpUYXhSMUJCMEFib2tfS3N1VEV3OA?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#16</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQb2NEbURwY1F2THA5UDhjTUpoZENtd2UwemZqUUtWYlRIbTlFTVFQME12ZzFyZGt5Y0haSW1lbUVPTjJiNTN2ZDNYcm9TRGVqem1VOFp3ZHJlekQxRXN3RUgxV2Q3amJzNDV3Q0pfTXB5anp3c25FYmI1XzU0M1FYUzJxbjZjakpJeThrVFZHQzdhcmpPYmpTQ3B4NzJhYmxGTHowVA?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#26</a>]. 중복 상장에 따른 주가 할인 우려가 해소되면서 시장은 이를 반겼고, SK하이닉스 주가는 4% 이상 반등하며 재무적 실탄 부담을 덜게 됐습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#5</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#14</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTE4tTHJkbTcxQ0REaGpNbzd3Mi1YT2lxRnVHU0FXajBrOUt1dFNxWVhlTGJrVTFqeGRQWVRqV0NERkdWd2t0M09YLWEybUNqb1VVamhYZFRlYmJnN21veC1CeFpIOHBRa241TlVv?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#18</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVEFVX3lxTE5nM0gwSTNneUhOaUhCM1JILXRRVmpuTVl6ZmJHQUszbUZfWDV2Tl8yeDNrQzlGU2hQMFpCcUtMSlNRdW9uQnIwR2lhVXM3R3JmVnR6WQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#35</a>].\n\n<b>2. 글로벌 IPO 시장의 열기와 온도 차</b>\n인도 지오 플랫폼스(Jio Platforms)의 IPO 청약이 22.19대 1을 기록하며 7.4조 루피 이상의 수요가 몰려 역대급 흥행 기록을 세웠습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#22</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#27</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQeF8tOXNNaEhIeFJLbUhDU25IN3FsQnZtQk9nenFCNFpBMnVEVk5tUl9oV1pCQS00MXFReUo1U0p3V2xndWxvSncxRTVsbVZUaXJpaUlzcHd3eU9OelUybVhRU1ZDSm1JNUFrMjdOc2JhQkE2eTBtcUxFbDFmeFRfMThDalhlZzRJbzFmMWFlMUlvY